# P1 history and papers used

Graph field base:

* Zhu, Ghahramani, Lafferty. Gaussian fields and harmonic functions on graphs. ([MLG Cambridge][1])

Graph signal processing framing:

* Shuman et al. Signal processing on graphs tutorial overview. ([Hajim School of Engineering][7])

Robust loss:

* Huber 1964 robust estimation paper. ([Project Euclid][2])

Mixture and latent assignment mechanics:

* Dempster, Laird, Rubin 1977 EM algorithm. ([JSTOR][3])

Tiered memory inspiration:

* MemGPT paper. ([arXiv][8])

Hierarchical retrieval neighbors:

* RAPTOR. ([arXiv][9])
* GraphRAG. ([arXiv][10])

Tiered storage and indexing:

* LSM-tree. ([UMass Boston CS][6])
* HNSW for ANN. ([arXiv][11])
* Product quantization. ([ACM Digital Library][5])

Lean proof infrastructure:

* mathlib4 docs and `Matrix.PosDef`. ([Lean Community][12])

